OL,3,AUK survivor of Canadian poison seller
OL,4,Asays he exploited her despair
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British woman, one of the survivors
OL,7,Fof Canadian poison seller Kenneth Law,
OL,8,Ffaced him in court on Wednesday to
OL,9,Fdescribe how he had exploited her
OL,10,Fvulnerability.
OL,12,FElisabeth Belien told the four-day
OL,13,Fsentencing hearing of Law in Ontario,
OL,14,FCanada she had been at her lowest ebb
OL,15,Fwhen he sold her toxic chemicals when
OL,16,Fshe was just 23.
OL,18,FBelien, who until Wednesday had not
OL,19,Fbeen known as one of his customers,
OL,20,Fsaid she had physically recovered after
OL,21,Fbeing successfully given an antidote by
OL,22,Fmedics.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,317,300,200,140,0,100
