OL,3,AUK survivor of Canadian poison seller
OL,4,Asays he exploited her despair
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut as she faced him as he sat in the
OL,7,Fglass-panelled dock, she revealed she
OL,8,Fhad suffered "survivor's guilt" after
OL,9,Flearning from police others had died.
